        "Four files, all auto-downloadable from the links on the loader nodes:\n\n- krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled  (diffusion_models)\n- qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled  (text_encoders) - type must be 'krea2'.\n  The vision tower matters: the encode node feeds both faces through it.\n- qwen_image_vae  (vae)\n- krea2_identity_edit_v1_2.safetensors  (loras)\n  from huggingface.co/conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit\n\nThe LoRA is what these nodes patch. Without it you get a plain Krea 2 render."
